        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for glibc-livepatches",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for glibc-livepatches fixes the following issue:\n\nSecurity fixes:\n\n- CVE-2026-4046: assertion failure when converting inputs may be used to remotely crash an application (bsc#1261209).\n\nOther fixes:\n\n- Fix problems with livepatches targeting libc-2.31.so instead of\n libc.so.6 in 15.4 (bsc#1263035).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
